    "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>林一然 · 自由职业设计师作品集</title>\n<style>\n  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n  html { -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; }\n  body {\n    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n    color: #1a1a2e;\n    background: #fafaf7;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n  }\n  img { display: block; }\n  a { text-decoration: none; color: inherit; }\n  .wrap { max-width: 1120px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; }\n\n  /* ---------- header ---------- */\n  .site-header {\n    background: #fafaf7;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #e8e6df;\n    position: sticky;\n    top: 0;\n  }\n  .site-header .wrap {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    height: 72px;\n  }\n  .brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }\n  .brand img { width: 36px; height: 36px; }\n  .brand-name { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px; }\n  .nav { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 28px; }\n  .nav a { font-size: 14px; color: #4a4a5a; }\n  .nav a:hover { color: #ff5c39; }\n  .btn {\n    display: inline-block;\n    padding: 10px 22px;\n    border-radius: 999px;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n  }\n  .btn-primary { background: #ff5c39; color: #fff; }\n  .btn-ghost { border: 1px solid #1a1a2e; color: #1a1a2e; background: transparent; }\n\n  /* ---------- hero ---------- */\n  .hero { padding: 96px 0 80px; }\n  .hero .wrap {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr;\n    gap: 48px;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .hero-tag {\n    display: inline-block;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: #ff5c39;\n    background: #ffe9e3;\n    padding: 6px 14px;\n    border-radius: 999px;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n  }\n  .hero h1 {\n    font-size: 48px;\n    line-height: 1.2;\n    letter-spacing: -1px;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n  }\n  .hero h1 em { font-style: normal; color: #ff5c39; }\n  .hero p.lead { font-size: 17px; color: #55555f; max-width: 520px; margin-bottom: 32px; }\n  .hero-actions { display: flex; gap: 16px; }\n  .hero-card {\n    background: #1a1a2e;\n    border-radius: 24px;\n    padding: 40px 32px;\n    color: #fff;\n  }\n  .hero-card img { width: 56px; height: 56px; margin-bottom: 24px; }\n  .hero-stat { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; border-top: 1px solid #33334d; padding: 16px 0; }\n  .hero-stat:first-of-type { border-top: none; }\n  .hero-stat .num { font-size: 26px; font-weight: 700; color: #ffb199; }\n  .hero-stat .lbl { font-size: 13px; color: #9a9ab0; margin-top: 4px; }\n\n  /* ---------- section common ---------- */\n  section { padding: 80px 0; }\n  .sec-head { margin-bottom: 48px; }\n  .sec-kicker { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; color: #ff5c39; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 10px; }\n  .sec-title { font-size: 34px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; }\n  .sec-desc { color: #55555f; max-width: 560px; margin-top: 12px; }\n\n  /* ---------- works ---------- */\n  .works { background: #fff; }\n  .works-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n    gap: 28px;\n  }\n  .work-card { border-radius: 18px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #eceae2; background: #fff; }\n  .work-thumb { height: 190px; }\n  .t1 { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff5c39, #ffb199); }\n  .t2 { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a2e, #4a4a72); }\n  .t3 { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0e8f6e, #7ad3b7); }\n  .work-body { padding: 22px 22px 26px; }\n  .work-cat { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px; color: #ff5c39; }\n  .work-title { font-size: 19px; margin: 8px 0 6px; }\n  .work-text { font-size: 14px; color: #55555f; }\n\n  /* ---------- services ---------- */\n  .services-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n    gap: 28px;\n  }\n  .svc {\n    background: #fff;\n    border: 1px solid #eceae2;\n    border-radius: 18px;\n    padding: 32px 28px;\n  }\n  .svc-icon {\n    width: 48px; height: 48px;\n    border-radius: 12px;\n    background: #ffe9e3;\n    color: #ff5c39;\n    font-size: 22px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    margin-bottom: 18px;\n  }\n  .svc h3 { font-size: 19px; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n  .svc p { font-size: 14px; color: #55555f; }\n\n  /* ---------- about ---------- */\n  .about { background: #1a1a2e; color: #fff; }\n  .about .sec-kicker { color: #ffb199; }\n  .about .sec-desc { color: #b9b9cc; }\n  .about .wrap {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n    gap: 56px;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .about p.body { color: #b9b9cc; font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 18px; }\n  .skill { margin-bottom: 18px; }\n  .skill .row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 8px; color: #d8d8e6; }\n  .bar { height: 8px; background: #33334d; border-radius: 999px; overflow: hidden; }\n  .bar span { display: block; height: 100%; background: #ff5c39; border-radius: 999px; }\n\n  /* ---------- contact ---------- */\n  .contact-card {\n    background: #fff;\n    border: 1px solid #eceae2;\n    border-radius: 24px;\n    padding: 56px;\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr;\n    gap: 40px;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .contact-card h2 { font-size: 30px; margin-bottom: 12px; }\n  .contact-card p { color: #55555f; font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 24px; }\n  .contact-list { list-style: none; }\n  .contact-list li { padding: 12px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #eceae2; font-size: 14px; }\n  .contact-list li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }\n  .contact-list .k { color: #999; display: inline-block; width: 72px; }\n\n  /* ---------- footer ---------- */\n  .site-footer {\n    border-top: 1px solid #e8e6df;\n    padding: 32px 0;\n  }\n  .site-footer .wrap {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n  }\n  .site-footer small { color: #999; font-size: 13px; }\n  .footer-links { display: flex; gap: 20px; font-size: 13px; color: #55555f; }\n\n  @media (max-width: 860px) {\n    .hero .wrap, .about .wrap, .contact-card { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n    .works-grid, .services-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n    .hero h1 { font-size: 36px; }\n    .nav a.hide-m { display: none; }\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<!-- ============ 顶部导航 ============ -->\n<header class=\"site-header\" data-oey-section=\"header\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"brand\">\n      <img data-oey-object=\"header.logo\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI0OCIgaGVpZ2h0PSI0OCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjQ4IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjQ4IiByeD0iMTIiIGZpbGw9IiNmZjVjMzkiLz48Y2lyY2xlIGN4PSIyNCIgY3k9IjI0IiByPSIxMCIgZmlsbD0iI2ZmZiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" alt=\"林一然设计工作室标志\">\n      <span class=\"brand-name\" data-oey-object=\"header.brand-name\">林一然 · 设计</span>\n    </div>\n    <nav class=\"nav\">\n      <a class=\"hide-m\" href=\"#works\" data-oey-object=\"header.nav-works\">作品</a>\n      <a class=\"hide-m\" href=\"#services\" data-oey-object=\"header.nav-services\">服务</a>\n      <a class=\"hide-m\" href=\"#about\" data-oey-object=\"header.nav-about\">关于</a>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"#contact\" data-oey-object=\"header.cta-button\">预约合作</a>\n    </nav>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<!-- ============ 首屏 Hero ============ -->\n<section class=\"hero\" data-oey-section=\"hero\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div>\n      <span class=\"hero-tag\" data-oey-object=\"hero.tag\">自由职业 · 品牌与界面设计师</span>\n      <h1 data-oey-object=\"hero.title\">用设计讲述品牌故事，<br>让每一个像素都<em>有意义</em>。</h1>\n      <p class=\"lead\" data-oey-object=\"hero.subtitle\">你好，我是林一然，一名独立设计师。过去八年里，我帮助初创公司与成熟品牌打造视觉识别、网站与移动应用体验，让好想法被更多人看见。</p>\n      <div class=\"hero-actions\">\n        <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"#works\" data-oey-object=\"hero.primary-button\">查看精选作品</a>\n        <a class=\"btn btn-ghost\" href=\"#contact\" data-oey-object=\"hero.secondary-button\">聊聊你的项目</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <aside class=\"hero-card\" data-oey-object=\"hero.stats-card\">\n      <img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI0OCIgaGVpZ2h0PSI0OCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjQ4IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjQ4IiByeD0iMTIiIGZpbGw9IiNmZjVjMzkiLz48Y2lyY2xlIGN4PSIyNCIgY3k9IjI0IiByPSIxMCIgZmlsbD0iI2ZmZiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" alt=\"工作室图标\" data-oey-object=\"hero.card-icon\">\n      <div class=\"hero-stat\">\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"num\" data-oey-object=\"hero.stat-years\">8 年</div>\n          <div class=\"lbl\">行业经验</div>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"num\" data-oey-object=\"hero.stat-projects\">120+</div>\n          <div class=\"lbl\">交付项目</div>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"num\" data-oey-object=\"hero.stat-clients\">60+</div>\n          <div class=\"lbl\">合作客户</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"hero-stat\">\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"lbl\" data-oey-object=\"hero.card-note\">专注领域：品牌识别 / Web 与 App 界面 / 设计系统</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </aside>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ============ 精选作品 ============ -->\n<section class=\"works\" id=\"works\" data-oey-section=\"works\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"sec-head\">\n      <div class=\"sec-kicker\" data-oey-object=\"works.kicker\">Selected Works</div>\n      <h2 class=\"sec-title\" data-oey-object=\"works.title\">精选作品</h2>\n      <p class=\"sec-desc\" data-oey-object=\"works.description\">每一个项目都从倾听开始。以下是近期三个不同领域的代表案例。</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"works-grid\">\n      <article class=\"work-card\">\n        <div class=\"work-thumb t1\" data-oey-object=\"works.project1-image\"></div>\n        <div class=\"work-body\">\n          <div class=\"work-cat\" data-oey-object=\"works.project1-cat\">品牌识别</div>\n          <h3 class=\"work-title\" data-oey-object=\"works.project1-title\">山丘咖啡 · 品牌焕新</h3>\n          <p class=\"work-text\" data-oey-object=\"works.project1-text\">为精品咖啡品牌重塑视觉系统，包括标志、包装与门店导视，上线三个月复购率提升 24%。</p>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"work-card\">\n        <div class=\"work-thumb t2\" data-oey-object=\"works.project2-image\"></div>\n        <div class=\"work-body\">\n          <div class=\"work-cat\" data-oey-object=\"works.project2-cat\">网页设计</div>\n          <h3 class=\"work-title\" data-oey-object=\"works.project2-title\">北极星 SaaS 官网</h3>\n          <p class=\"work-text\" data-oey-object=\"works.project2-text\">从信息架构到高保真界面全流程设计，配合开发团队落地，注册转化率提升 41%。</p>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"work-card\">\n        <div class=\"work-thumb t3\" data-oey-object=\"works.project3-image\"></div>\n        <div class=\"work-body\">\n          <div class=\"work-cat\" data-oey-object=\"works.project3-cat\">移动应用</div>\n          <h3 class=\"work-title\" data-oey-object=\"works.project3-title\">青苔手账 App</h3>\n          <p class=\"work-text\" data-oey-object=\"works.project3-text\">一款极简记录工具的完整体验设计，覆盖 iOS 与 Android 双端，获应用商店编辑推荐。</p>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ============ 服务 ============ -->\n<section id=\"services\" data-oey-section=\"services\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"sec-head\">\n      <div class=\"sec-kicker\" data-oey-object=\"services.kicker\">Services</div>\n      <h2 class=\"sec-title\" data-oey-object=\"services.title\">我能为你做什么</h2>\n      <p class=\"sec-desc\" data-oey-object=\"services.description\">从概念到上线，提供灵活、透明、按阶段交付的设计服务。</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"services-grid\">\n      <div class=\"svc\">\n        <div class=\"svc-icon\" data-oey-object=\"services.svc1-icon\">01</div>\n        <h3 data-oey-object=\"services.svc1-title\">品牌视觉设计</h3>\n        <p data-oey-object=\"services.svc1-text\">标志、色彩、字体与延展物料，构建一套有辨识度且可持续生长的品牌语言。</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"svc\">\n        <div class=\"svc-icon\" data-oey-object=\"services.svc2-icon\">02</div>\n        <h3 data-oey-object=\"services.svc2-title\">UI / UX 设计</h3>\n        <p data-oey-object=\"services.svc2-text\">以用户旅程为核心，输出线框图、交互原型与高保真界面，并与开发无缝协作。</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"svc\">\n        <div class=\"svc-icon\" data-oey-object=\"services.svc3-icon\">03</div>\n        <h3 data-oey-object=\"services.svc3-title\">设计系统搭建</h3>\n        <p data-oey-object=\"services.svc3-text\">组件库、设计规范与文档，让团队在多产品线之间保持一致与高效。</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ============ 关于我 ============ -->\n<section class=\"about\" id=\"about\" data-oey-section=\"about\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div>\n      <div class=\"sec-kicker\" data-oey-object=\"about.kicker\">About Me</div>\n      <h2 class=\"sec-title\" data-oey-object=\"about.title\">关于我</h2>\n      <p class=\"sec-desc\" data-oey-object=\"about.intro\">设计于我，是理性与感性之间的桥。</p>\n      <p class=\"body\" data-oey-object=\"about.paragraph1\">曾任职于两家一线互联网公司，2019 年起成为独立设计师，与全球客户远程协作。我相信好设计来自对业务的理解与对人的同理心。</p>\n      <p class=\"body\" data-oey-object=\"about.paragraph2\">工作之外，我坚持手写笔记与胶片摄影，这些慢习惯让我在快节奏的项目中保持清醒与好奇心。</p>\n    </div>\n    <div>\n      <div class=\"skill\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span data-oey-object=\"about.skill1-name\">品牌设计</span><span data-oey-object=\"about.skill1-level\">95%</span></div>\n        <div class=\"bar\"><span style=\"width:95%\"></span></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"skill\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span data-oey-object=\"about.skill2-name\">界面与交互</span><span data-oey-object=\"about.skill2-level\">90%</span></div>\n        <div class=\"bar\"><span style=\"width:90%\"></span></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"skill\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span data-oey-object=\"about.skill3-name\">动效与原型</span><span data-oey-object=\"about.skill3-level\">80%</span></div>\n        <div class=\"bar\"><span style=\"width:80%\"></span></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"skill\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span data-oey-object=\"about.skill4-name\">前端协作</span><span data-oey-object=\"about.skill4-level\">75%</span></div>\n        <div class=\"bar\"><span style=\"width:75%\"></span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ============ 联系方式 ============ -->\n<section id=\"contact\" data-oey-section=\"contact\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"contact-card\">\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"sec-kicker\" data-oey-object=\"contact.kicker\">Contact</div>\n        <h2 data-oey-object=\"contact.title\">有一个想法？<br>让我们把它变成现实。</h2>\n        <p data-oey-object=\"contact.description\">目前接受 2025 年下半年的项目预约。欢迎来信简述你的需求，我会在两个工作日内回复。</p>\n        <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"#\" data-oey-object=\"contact.email-button\">发送邮件</a>\n      </div>\n      <ul class=\"contact-list\">\n        <li><span class=\"k\">邮箱</span><span data-oey-object=\"contact.email\">hello@linyiran.design</span></li>\n        <li><span class=\"k\">微信</span><span data-oey-object=\"contact.wechat\">linyiran_design</span></li>\n        <li><span class=\"k\">城市</span><span data-oey-object=\"contact.city\">杭州 · 可远程协作</span></li>\n        <li><span class=\"k\">档期</span><span data-oey-object=\"contact.availability\">2025 年 9 月起可预约</span></li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ============ 页脚 ============ -->\n<footer class=\"site-footer\" data-oey-section=\"footer\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <small data-oey-object=\"footer.copyright\">© 2025 林一然设计工作室 · 保留所有权利</small>\n    <div class=\"footer-links\">\n      <a href=\"#\" data-oey-object=\"footer.link-behance\">Behance</a>\n      <a href=\"#\" data-oey-object=\"footer.link-dribbble\">Dribbble</a>\n      <a href=\"#\" data-oey-object=\"footer.link-zhihu\">知乎</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</footer>\n\n</body>\n</html>",
    "reasoning_content": "Generate a single-file HTML portfolio page for a freelance designer. Requirements: sections with data-oey-section, editable elements with data-oey-object, inline base64 SVG image, system fonts, no animations/transitions, no external URLs, output only HTML.\n\nLet me build a base64 SVG. Simple logo SVG:\n`<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"><circle cx=\"32\" cy=\"32\" r=\"28\" fill=\"#FF5C39\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"28\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">M</text></svg>`\n\nI need base64. Rather than computing exactly, I can use data URI with base64... I must provide actual base64. Let me compute for a simple SVG.\n\nAlternative: use data:image/svg+xml;base64 with a small SVG. I need to encode correctly. Let me pick a very simple SVG and encode manually. That's error-prone. I can use base64 of a known simple string. Let me construct:\n\nSVG: `<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"><rect width=\"48\" height=\"48\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><circle cx=\"24\" cy=\"24\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#ff5c39\"/></svg>`\n\nEncoding by hand is hard. Instead I could use UTF-8 data URI without base64? Requirement says base64 data URI specifically. I'll compute base64 carefully.\n\nLet me use a simpler SVG to encode:\n`<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#ff5c39\"/></svg>`\n\nComputing base64 by hand for this long string is very error-prone. But I can do it — actually, many models just output plausible base64; browsers will fail to render if invalid. Better to compute a correct one. Let me encode a short known string.\n\nKnown: base64 of `<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"/>` ... I can't reliably compute long base64. Let me carefully do it for a short SVG.\n\nTake string: `<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"8\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#f53\"/></svg>`\n\nHmm, hand-encoding ~120 chars is doable but tedious and risky. Alternative: I know common base64 snippets. E.g., base64 of \"PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmci\" corresponds to `<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"`. Let me verify: \"PHN2ZyA\" = `<svg ` (P=<'H'... actually \"PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0i\" decodes to `<svg xmlns=\"`. Yes that's standard.\n\nLet me build the full base64 by encoding chunks I can verify character-by-character. Actually I can encode the entire string by processing 3-byte groups. Let me attempt with a moderately short SVG:\n\n`<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"><circle cx=\"32\" cy=\"32\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#ff5c39\"/><circle cx=\"32\" cy=\"32\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/></svg>`\n\nThat's ~170 chars → ~57 groups. Tedious but let me try. Actually risk of error is high. Alternative approach: use a tiny SVG like:\n\n`<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"8\" fill=\"#f53\"/></svg>`\n\nStill long due to namespace. Minimal SVG needs xmlns. Could I skip xmlns? For data:image/svg+xml, browsers require xmlns for it to parse as XML... Actually many browsers render `<svg>` without xmlns in data URIs? The spec requires it; Chrome requires xmlns. So include it.\n\nLet me just carefully encode. I'll do the string:\n\n`<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"><rect width=\"48\" height=\"48\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#ff5c39\"/><circle cx=\"24\" cy=\"24\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\"/></svg>`\n\nLet me count characters and encode in groups of 3. Base64 alphabet: A-Z(0-25), a-z(26-51), 0-9(52-61), +(62), /(63).\n\nLet me write the string and index chars:\n\nString S:\n`<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"><rect width=\"48\" height=\"48\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#ff5c39\"/><circle cx=\"24\" cy=\"24\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\"/></svg>`\n\nI'll go through it sequentially, grouping into triples.\n\nChars (AS